01:21:31.000 --> 01:21:34.000
Dr. Masoud: But now you are just completely different. Dr. Khalifa: This will never change.

01:21:34.000 --> 01:21:35.000
Dr. Khalifa: This will never change.

01:21:35.000 --> 01:21:37.000
Dr. Masoud: And this is really, really disappointing.

01:21:37.000 --> 01:21:41.000
Dr. Khalifa: What do you think Behrouz said, and what do you think should be done?

01:21:41.000 --> 01:21:46.000
Dr. Masoud: I cannot judge on that because I don't know really, I cannot retroactive, you know, what happened over there.

01:21:46.000 --> 01:21:52.000
So, I'm not going, I'm going to leave these two together. But we are going to go back to the community that Dr. Sabahi was in.

01:21:52.000 --> 01:21:54.000
Dr. Masoud: We are going to love each other.

01:21:54.000 --> 01:21:56.000
Dr. Masoud: We are going to respect each other. Dr. Khalifa: Yes.

01:21:56.000 --> 01:21:59.000
Dr. Masoud: And we are going to apologize to each other, every one of us.

01:21:59.000 --> 01:22:02.000
Dr. Masoud: For what happened over here today and what we are teaching our children today.

01:22:03.000 --> 01:22:09.000
Dr. Khalifa: This is exactly what Behrouz was calling for. He doesn't want, he wants to follow what, what God is saying

01:22:09.000 --> 01:22:13.000
to ensure that we are a family. Because God said the believers are a family.

01:22:13.000 --> 01:22:14.000
Dr. Khalifa: Douglas.

01:22:14.000 --> 01:22:18.000
Douglas: In Sura 39, verse 18, God says,

01:22:18.000 --> 01:22:27.000
[39:18] They are the ones who examine all words, then follow the best. These are the ones whom GOD has guided; these are the ones who possess intelligence.

01:22:27.000 --> 01:22:36.000
And I think that one of the things that Satan's doing here is that he is making people feel that their words are better than someone else's.

01:22:36.000 --> 01:22:40.000
And what we're supposed to do is that whenever we discuss anything or follow

01:22:40.000 --> 01:22:45.000
the messenger of God or what have you, the ultimate is always God's words.

01:22:45.000 --> 01:22:50.000
Another verse in the Quran is in Sura 58, verse 10. It says,

01:22:50.000 --> 01:22:55.000
[58:10] Secret conspiracy is the devil's idea, through which he seeks to hurt those who believed. ...

01:22:55.000 --> 01:22:58.000
He seeks to hurt those who believe.

01:22:58.000 --> 01:23:03.000
[58:10] ... However, he cannot hurt them against GOD's will. In GOD the believers shall trust.

01:23:03.000 --> 01:23:09.000
And I think we all should remember that God says in the Quran that He's aware of the innermost thoughts.

01:23:09.000 --> 01:23:14.000
And He will cause to come forth in us all of our weaknesses.

01:23:14.000 --> 01:23:21.000
That He will bring out our weaknesses according to His will and that when these weaknesses come out,

01:23:21.000 --> 01:23:30.000
if we are really sincere and we worship God alone, we will pray to Allah to face them in ourselves and we will follow what is best.

01:23:31.000 --> 01:23:35.000
We will follow and examine the words and follow what, what is best

01:23:35.000 --> 01:23:40.000
and we will not try to defend our own weaknesses and our own opinions and our own words.

01:23:41.000 --> 01:23:47.000
Because I, I think all of us do and God knows this. This is an extremely critical time.

01:23:47.000 --> 01:23:53.000
Not just this situation, but in a very short time and I think all of us feel this.

01:23:54.000 --> 01:24:02.000
The miracle in the Quran, the awareness that Rashad is the Messenger of the Covenant is going to spread like wildfire.

01:24:03.000 --> 01:24:08.000
It is going to spread like wildfire. It's almost as if we are on the verge

01:24:08.000 --> 01:24:12.000
Douglas: of major events that, and so the family

01:24:12.000 --> 01:24:14.000
Douglas: has to be prepared. Dr. Khalifa: And Satan doesn't like,

01:24:14.000 --> 01:24:15.000
Dr. Khalifa: Satan doesn't like it. Douglas: When you,

01:24:15.000 --> 01:24:21.000
Douglas: when you know that people are coming to your house, what do you do? You run and pick up the trash and straighten up and try to make it look good.

01:24:21.000 --> 01:24:25.000
Douglas: We have to be prepared for what is about to take place.

01:24:26.000 --> 01:24:30.000
Dr. Khalifa: Alhamdu Lillah. Let us now turn to God and ask him. God never turns us down.

01:24:30.000 --> 01:24:35.000
We're going to recite Al-Fãtehah that He may keep us all in His path and not a single one in this place,

01:24:35.000 --> 01:24:40.000
not a single one is to, to, to be driven away from the path of God.

01:24:41.000 --> 01:24:45.000
So, we'll leave it in God's hand. He is the only One who can solve our problems.

