[3:130] O you who believe, you shall not take usury, compounded over and over. You shall observe GOD, that you may succeed.

01:25:49.000 --> 01:25:53.000
[3:131] Beware of the hellfire that awaits the disbelievers.

01:25:53.000 --> 01:25:58.000
[3:132] You shall obey GOD and the messenger, that you may attain mercy.

