01:26:03.000 --> 01:26:09.000
We have discussed in great deal, detail about usury a few weeks ago.

01:26:09.000 --> 01:26:15.000
But going back to one of the verses, chapter 2, verse 275.

01:26:17.000 --> 01:26:20.000
There is a good section about this.

01:26:21.000 --> 01:26:48.000
[2:275] Those who take usury are in the same position as those who are possessed by the devil. This is because they claim that usury is the same as trade. GOD has made trade lawful, and has made usury unlawful. Whoever heeds this commandment from his Lord, and refrains from usury, he may keep his past earnings, and his judgment rests with GOD. As for those who persist, they incur Hell, they abide therein forever.

01:26:48.000 --> 01:26:50.000
This is exactly what God is telling us here.

01:26:50.000 --> 01:26:54.000
And we should realize what the difference is between trade and usury,

01:26:54.000 --> 01:26:59.000
where usury is lending money at excessive interest and taking advantage of the situation.

01:26:59.000 --> 01:27:04.000
Especially in this section, where God is teaching us about the war. It was war time.

01:27:05.000 --> 01:27:09.000
We have talked about the battle of Badr last week.

01:27:09.000 --> 01:27:15.000
And some people, because of the economic situation, could very much take advantage of that,

01:27:15.000 --> 01:27:17.000
and hurt others.

01:27:17.000 --> 01:27:21.000
And God teaches us that that is evil.

01:27:21.000 --> 01:27:30.000
And the people who commit this wicked act, their place is in the hellfire and they are disbelievers.

01:27:31.000 --> 01:27:38.000
And definitely, this is given to us many times from God and the messenger confirms it.

01:27:38.000 --> 01:27:46.000
And we should attain certainty about it and have... so that we can have mercy from God.

